# Profiling tool output (benchmarks/performance/{maqao,malt}/profile_*.sh) — ignored by
# directory rather than extension: MAQAO's oneview pass writes .json/.html/.lua files and
# copies the built binary itself into the experiment dir (no extension to match), and MALT's
# report is .json. perf's own output is already covered by the extension patterns above.
benchmarks/performance/maqao/results/
benchmarks/performance/malt/results/

